    "translation": "left to drink from a scalding spring"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 88,
    "ayah_number": 6,
    "global_ayah_id": 6060,
    "translation": "They will have no food except a foul, thorny shrub"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 88,
    "ayah_number": 7,
    "global_ayah_id": 6061,
    "translation": "neither nourishing nor satisfying hunger"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 88,
    "ayah_number": 8,
    "global_ayah_id": 6062,
    "translation": "On that Day ˹other˺ faces will be glowing with bliss"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 88,
    "ayah_number": 9,
    "global_ayah_id": 6063,
    "translation": "˹fully˺ pleased with their striving"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 88,
    "ayah_number": 10,
    "global_ayah_id": 6064,
    "translation": "in an elevated Garden"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 88,
    "ayah_number": 11,
    "global_ayah_id": 6065,
    "translation": "where no idle talk will be heard"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 88,
    "ayah_number": 12,
    "global_ayah_id": 6066,
    "translation": "In it will be a running spring"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 88,
    "ayah_number": 13,
    "global_ayah_id": 6067,
    "translation": "along with thrones raised high"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 88,
    "ayah_number": 14,
    "global_ayah_id": 6068,
    "translation": "and cups set at hand"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 88,
    "ayah_number": 15,
    "global_ayah_id": 6069,
    "translation": "and ˹fine˺ cushions lined up"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 88,
    "ayah_number": 16,
    "global_ayah_id": 6070,
    "translation": "and ˹splendid˺ carpets spread out"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 88,
    "ayah_number": 17,
    "global_ayah_id": 6071,
    "translation": "Do they not ever reflect on camels—how they were ˹masterfully˺ created"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 88,
    "ayah_number": 18,
    "global_ayah_id": 6072,
    "translation": "and the sky—how it was raised ˹high˺"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 88,
    "ayah_number": 19,
    "global_ayah_id": 6073,
    "translation": "and the mountains—how they were firmly set up"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 88,
    "ayah_number": 20,
    "global_ayah_id": 6074,
    "translation": "and the earth—how it was levelled out"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 88,
    "ayah_number": 21,
    "global_ayah_id": 6075,
    "translation": "So, ˹continue to˺ remind ˹all, O Prophet˺, for your duty is only to remind"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 88,
    "ayah_number": 22,
    "global_ayah_id": 6076,
